Job Description:

We are looking for an experienced Senior Android Engineer who can build and ship apps using the latest technology on Android devices to deliver innovative digital experiences that serve consumers and also should have exposure towards iOS app development.
The ideal candidate should have a deep knowledge of Android Native, along with a commitment to collaborative problem-solving, sophisticated design and solid reliability.

Core Skills:

·     Kotlin, Java, and Jetpack Compose Knowledge in Swift and SwiftUI
·     Tools: JIRA, Git, Android Studio, XCode
·     Solid understanding of Mobile App Development life cycle like design, develop, test and deployment
·     Proficient in object-oriented programming, following SOLID principles and MVVM, Viper, MVC ,Clean architectures
·     Familiarity with RESTful APIs, third-party libraries, and integration with back-end services.
·     Knowledge of mobile development best practices, Debugging, including UI/UX design principles
·     Working knowledge of Agile and Scrum, CI/CD
·     Experience with writing Unit tests Follow Clean Architecture and MVVM principles

Key Responsibilities:

·     Develop high quality, consumer-grade features on Android using Kotlin and in iOS using SwiftUI
·     Ensure the performance, quality, and responsiveness of applications.
·     Collaborate with team to define, design, test, and ship new features.
·     Utilize standards and methodologies to maintain code quality and organization.
·     Provides story or business requirements breakdown planning and estimates.